usr_prompt:  Context: It takes a particular talent to be a successful business manager. Business courses can help people to solve management problems, but such courses can do so only for those people with managerial talent. Such people should take business courses to acquire ideas that they can subsequently use to good advantage if management problems happen to arise.
Question: If the statements above are true, which of the following must also be true on the basis of them?
