usr_prompt:  Context: A proposed change to federal income tax laws would eliminate deductions from taxable income for donations a taxpayer has made to charitable and educational institutions. If this change were adopted, wealthy individuals would no longer be permitted such deductions. Ttherefore, many charitable and educational institutions would have to reduce services, and some would have to close their doors.
